{% comment %}
  BLED FAKE — Manifesto Page Section (bled-manifesto.liquid)
  The underground declaration. Heavy typography, full brutalist layout.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="bf-page bf-manifesto-page" aria-label="BLED FAKE Manifesto">
  <div class="bf-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="bf-header" role="banner">
    <a href="/" class="bf-logo-link" aria-label="BLED FAKE — Home">
      {%- render 'bled-logo' -%}
      <span class="visually-hidden">BLED FAKE</span>
    </a>
    <div class="bf-nav-right">
      <button class="bf-nav-btn" data-cart-open aria-label="Open cart">
        <span>BAG</span>
        <span class="bf-cart-badge-count bf-cart-count">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
      </button>
      <button class="bf-nav-btn" data-menu-open aria-label="Open menu">
        <span>MENU</span>
        <div class="bf-hamburger" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bf-hamburger__line"></div>
          <div class="bf-hamburger__line"></div>
        </div>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Manifesto Content -->
  <article class="bf-manifesto-content" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">

    <!-- Opening statement — massive typography -->
    <div class="bf-manifesto-opening" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="bf-manifesto-overline">TUNIS // {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} // UNDERGROUND</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="bf-manifesto-headline" itemprop="headline">
      WE DON'T<br>HATE TUNISIA.
    </h1>
    <h2 class="bf-manifesto-sub-headline">
      WE HATE <span class="bf-manifesto-em">THE ILLUSION.</span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Body text in brutalist columns -->
    <div class="bf-manifesto-body" itemprop="text">

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para bf-manifesto-para--large">
        This is not a brand story. This is a police report.
        A document of what happens when a generation refuses to pretend.
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-divider"><span>I</span></div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para">
        We grew up watching Tunisia sell itself. To tourism. To foreign investment.
        To a narrative of stability while the streets told a completely different story.
        <em>Bled</em> was supposed to mean home. It started to feel like a stage set.
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para">
        BLED FAKE is the name we gave the gap between the postcard and the pavement.
        Between the official story and the one your neighbour tells at 2am.
        We wear that gap. We print it on heavyweight cotton and ship it to your door.
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-divider"><span>II</span></div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para bf-manifesto-para--pullquote">
        "The garment is the argument.<br>
        The wearer is the proof."
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para">
        Every piece we make is a limited document. We don't restock. We don't dilute.
        When a drop is gone, it becomes part of the archive — a timestamp on a specific moment
        in Tunisian underground culture. You either caught it or you didn't.
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-divider"><span>III</span></div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para">
        <strong>BLED FAKE</strong> is the confrontation line. Oversized, stencilled, in your face.<br>
        <strong>BLED HORRA</strong> is the quiet line. Free Tunisia. Raw edges, understated, uncompromising.<br>
        <strong>COMEBACK TOMORROW</strong> is the endurance line. Built for the long game. Tactical, technical, permanent.
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-divider"><span>IV</span></div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para">
        We ship from Tunis. We photograph in Tunis. We pay Tunisian creatives,
        Tunisian photographers, Tunisian seamstresses.
        The money stays. The culture stays. The illusion gets exposed.
      </div>

      <div class="bf-manifesto-para bf-manifesto-para--closing">
        This is the reality.<br>
        Enter it.
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Signature -->
    <div class="bf-manifesto-sig">
      <span class="bf-manifesto-sig__brand">BLED FAKE</span>
      <span class="bf-manifesto-sig__loc">TUNIS, TUNISIA</span>
    </div>

  </article>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bf-page-cta-band">
    <a href="/collections/all" class="bf-page-cta-btn">
      <span>ENTER THE DROPS</span>
      <span>→</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/pages/about" class="bf-page-cta-btn bf-page-cta-btn--outline">
      <span>WHO WE ARE</span>
      <span>→</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <footer class="bf-page-footer">
    <span>BLED FAKE // TUNIS // {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }}</span>
    <span>BLEDFAKE 2026</span>
  </footer>

</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BLED Manifesto",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "BLED Manifesto Page" }]
}
{% endschema %}
